== the naming charge of a Fourier type family (fixed-alphabet view, Sec. 1.7 of engine3-open-door.md):
   T = k(G) >= |G|/d_max^2 >= N^6/d_max^2 for a TPP <N^3,N^3,N^3>  =>  1.5 log2 T + 3 log2 d_max >= 9 lambda = raw.
   S_3^3                                       : k(G)=  27, 1.5 log2 k =   7.13, 3 log2 d_max =  9.00, sum =  16.13 vs raw 9 (trade needs game value + 1.5 log2 T < 9)
   (Cyc_3^3)^2x|Cyc_2 (<12,12,12> >= <8,8,8>)  : k(G)= 405, 1.5 log2 k =  12.99, 3 log2 d_max =  3.00, sum =  15.99 vs raw 9 (trade needs game value + 1.5 log2 T < 9)
   S_6 (<12,12,12> >= <8,8,8>)                 : k(G)=  11, 1.5 log2 k =   5.19, 3 log2 d_max = 12.00, sum =  17.19 vs raw 9 (trade needs game value + 1.5 log2 T < 9)

